@startuml Sequence_DevicePairing
title Привязка устройства к пользователю

actor User
participant "API Gateway" as GW
participant "SmartHome API" as SH
database "SmartHome DB" as DB
participant "Mosquitto" as MQTT
participant "IoT Device" as DEV

== 1. Регистрация и аутентификация ==
User -> GW: POST /api/v2/users/register
GW -> SH: Forward
SH -> DB: INSERT user
SH --> User: user_id

User -> GW: POST /api/v2/users/login
GW -> SH: Forward
SH --> User: JWT token

== 2. Привязка устройства ==
User -> GW: POST /api/v2/devices\n{device_id, name, device_type}\nAuthorization: Bearer {token}
GW -> SH: Forward

SH -> SH: Validate JWT
SH -> DB: INSERT device\n(user_id from JWT)
DB --> SH: device record

SH -> MQTT: Publish to devices/paired\n{device_id, user_id, ...}

SH --> GW: 201 Created
GW --> User: Device paired

note right of DEV
  Устройство подключено
  к MQTT брокеру и
  отправляет телеметрию
end note

@enduml
